    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a read-write view of a CodeView string table. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1codeview_1_1_debug_string_table_subsection" kindref="compound">DebugStringTableSubsection</ref> owns the underlying storage for the table, and is capable of serializing the string table into a format understood by <ref refid="classllvm_1_1codeview_1_1_debug_string_table_subsection_ref" kindref="compound">DebugStringTableSubsectionRef</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
